@startuml F1.9-D08-download-anexo
title F1.9-D08 — Download de anexo (presigned)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "AttachmentController" as Ctrl
participant "MinIO" as MinIO

Aluno -> WebApp: Baixar anexo
WebApp -> Jwt: pede URL do anexo
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok + dono
Ctrl -> MinIO: gera URL GET\npresigned (TTL 15 min)
MinIO --> Ctrl: URL
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + URL
WebApp -> MinIO: GET arquivo
MinIO --> Aluno: download

@enduml
